  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Umbrella Programme for Advisory Services to MoFA-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The umbrella cooperation between the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and UNDP frames MoFA&#x2019;s strategic objectives around four initial outputs, with flexibility to adapt annually based on evolving priorities. Activities will be set each year in coordination with MoFA&#x2019;s deputyships and reviewed for ministerial approval, ensuring strong national ownership. The outputs focus on: (1) strategic planning and foresight, (2) governance, financial management, and operational efficiency, (3) talent development,</narrative>
  </description>
